 **Inputs and Outputs**
-*   **Input:** A set of $N$ control points (anchors) $P = \{p_0, p_1, \dots, p_{N-1}\}$, where each point $p_i$ contains a scalar position $pos_i$ and visual values (e.g., color $c_i \in \mathbb{R}^3$ and opacity $\alpha_i \in \mathbb{R}$). The positions must be sorted in ascending order [S6, S7, unofficial].
+*   **Input:** A set of $N$ control points (anchors) $P = \{p_0, p_1, \dots, p_{N-1}\}$, where each point $p_i$ contains a scalar position $pos_i$ and visual values (e.g., color $c_i \in \mathbb{R}^3$ and opacity $\alpha_i \in \mathbb{R}$) [S2, S7, unofficial].
 *   **Input:** A query scalar value $v$ from the volume data [S7, S8, unofficial].
 *   **Output:** Interpolated color $C(v)$ and opacity $\alpha(v)$ [S7, S8, unofficial].
 
 **Data Structures**
